Package: coreip-server-inspector
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CoreIP Systems Engineering <support@coreip.local>
Depends: ca-certificates
Recommends: smartmontools
Description: Production Linux server hardware inventory and health monitoring application.
 CoreIP Server Inspector provides local and secure remote web-based inspection
 of Ubuntu and CentOS/RHEL servers, physical storage diagnostics, live monitoring,
 and downloadable system reports without requiring external databases or runtimes.

